~ start
if not PlayerStats.in_photo
	match PlayerStats.scene_progress
		when 0
			if not PlayerStats.has_food2
				Max: Puto bumbong! I remember downing 8 plates of it when I was a kid.
				Max: I was on our porcelain throne for a solid 2 hours after that incident.
				Max: For sure grabbing some for the road.
				$> PlayerStats.has_food2 = true
			else
				Max: Nothing much here.
		when 2
			Max: I've already gathered enough pasalubong.
else
	Max: I can't exactly grab anything from the past.
=> END